{"tool": "read", "arguments": {"initiative": "export-jobs", "node": "01a15961-fb86-76c1-8303-f635b8bae611"}, "response": {"api_version": 1, "coverage": {"complete": true, "initiatives": ["export-jobs"], "omitted": [], "rules_complete": true}, "data": {"conflicts": [], "node": {"body": "The three downstream reporting jobs (report-a, report-b, report-c in the local workspace) must never write directly to the shared destination. Write to staging first, verify that the SHA-256 checksum matches the input, and promote only after successful verification. A previous half-written file caused a day of lost work. Configured these three jobs with destination storage/shared, staging_destination storage/staging, and verify_checksum=true. Verified successful staging/verification/promotion and injected checksum mismatch preserving the existing shared output for each job in isolated temporary workspaces.", "body_range": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T12:55:56+00:00", "currentness": "current", "id": "01a15961-fb86-76c1-8303-f635b8bae611", "initiatives": ["export-jobs"], "layer": "warm", "metadata_is_current": true, "name": "reporting-export-staging-policy", "node_type": "reference", "properties": {"constraint_state": "active", "kind": "constraint"}, "recorded_at": "2026-10-20T12:55:56+00:00", "revision": "f1587850c397de7adee93805c9fe4e8361019170048fb58bbe6fd03822bfc639", "status": null, "successors": [], "tags": ["kind:constraint", "sig:medium", "lang:en", "topic:staging", "topic:reporting", "topic:reporting-export-staging-policy", "topic:export", "topic:policy"], "tier": "archival", "visibility": "local"}, "path": [], "provenance": [], "reasoning": [], "relations": []}, "issues": [], "operation": "read", "replayed": false, "request_id": null, "state": "ok"}, "error": null, "status": "completed"}
{"tool": "note", "arguments": {"initiative": "export-jobs", "name": "finance-export-staging-policy", "kind": "constraint", "body": "The user extended the reporting export staging requirement to the two ad hoc exports feeding the finance sheet, finance-a and finance-b. These must write to storage/staging first, verify the SHA-256 checksum against the input, and promote to storage/shared only after it matches; never write directly to shared. Configured both jobs accordingly with verify_checksum=true. Verified successful staging, checksum verification and promotion, and injected checksum mismatches preserving the existing shared output for both jobs in isolated temporary workspaces.", "related": {"to": "01a15961-fb86-76c1-8303-f635b8bae611", "type": "refers_to", "weight": 0.9}}, "response": {"api_version": 1, "data": {"affected": [], "artifacts": [], "changes": [], "created": [{"id": "01a15962-e9d6-7610-a6c7-d2207940fe45", "revision": "6fdb79838335b9e6442b123e0ab470719ca64243f6fe2fe481c7ec955bb453cf"}], "evidence": [], "failed_steps": [], "primary": {"id": "01a15962-e9d6-7610-a6c7-d2207940fe45", "revision": "6fdb79838335b9e6442b123e0ab470719ca64243f6fe2fe481c7ec955bb453cf"}, "slots": []}, "issues": [], "operation": "note", "replayed": false, "request_id": null, "state": "applied"}, "error": null, "status": "completed"}
